  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nAn ordinary incoming hit is
    reduced by 25% if at least 6s have passed since the last recorded hero injury.
    This protection does not stack from multiple copies; deliberate health costs
    are not reduced.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nChampion / Armor correction: +2.5%\nChampion
    / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces
    support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA gambling-hall accountant
    who found the house erasing winners from its records. They kept a crooked die
    as evidence rather than letting it decide every choice. They seek the families
    of the removed names.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nEvery 4s in combat, gain 0 gold directly.
    This is not kill loot and does not count as collecting a coin.\r\n\nNamed talents
    count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied
    by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately
    at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: oddity, resolve. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; three
    equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
